{{!
    @template core_course/category_actionbar

    Displays the tertiary nav for the category page, overridden by Dimensions.

    Modification compared to the original template:
    * The category selector is removed. Core builds it from make_categories_list(), which names
      every category on the site with no capability required, so where a category may be
      unlisted the selector would reveal the whole tree. Removing it in the template rather than
      in the renderer keeps the rest of the action bar (the search box and the additional
      options) as core and Boost Union draw it, without a copy of Boost Union's course_category().
      The example below keeps the context key the selector read, unused, so the diff against
      core stays readable.
    * The example context gives additionaloptions the string the action bar exports - a rendered
      action menu, or the empty string (see
      \core_course\output\category_action_bar::export_for_template()). Core's own example
      declares an object there, which the triple stash cannot render ("Object of class stdClass
      could not be converted to string"); the plugin CI's mustache lint renders the example of
      every template the plugin ships, never core's own. Do not copy the object back.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * search Object - The core/search_input context of the search box
    * additionaloptions String - The rendered action menu HTML, or the empty string

    Example context (json):
    {
        "categoryselect" : {
            "formid": "url_select_f61834256d7754158",
            "classes": "urlselect",
            "label": "",
            "disabled": false,
            "title":null,
            "id":"url_select61834256d7754159",
            "sesskey":"LWILINyZMH",
            "action":"http:\/\/localhost\/stable_master\/course\/jumpto.php",
            "showbutton":null,
            "options": [
                {
                    "name":"Category 1",
                    "value":"\/course\/index.php\/?categoryid=279"
                },
                {
                    "name":"Category 2",
                    "value":"\/course\/index.php\/?categoryid=280"
                },
                {
                    "name":"Category 3",
                    "value":"\/course\/index.php\/?categoryid=281"
                }
            ],
            "labelattributes":[],
            "helpicon":false,
            "attributes":[]
        },
        "search": {
            "action": "https://moodle.local/admin/search.php",
            "extraclasses": "my-2",
            "inputname": "search",
            "inform": false,
            "searchstring": "Search settings",
            "value": "policy",
            "btnclass": "primary",
            "query": "themedesigner",
            "hiddenfields": [
                {
                    "name": "context",
                    "value": "11"
                }
            ]
        },
        "additionaloptions": "<div class=\"action-menu\"><a href=\"\/course\/edit.php?category=281\">Action 1<\/a><\/div>"
    }
}}
<div class="container-fluid tertiary-navigation" id="action_bar">
    <div class="d-flex">
        {{#search}}
            <div class="navitem">
                {{> core/search_input }}
            </div>
        {{/search}}
        {{{additionaloptions}}}
    </div>
</div>
